{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12776","headline":"送李司直赴江西使幕 · 韩翃","name":"送李司直赴江西使幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敛版辞汉廷，进帆归楚幕。\n三江城上转，九里人家泊。\n好酒近宜城，能诗谢康乐。\n雨晴西山树，日出南昌郭。\n竹露点衣巾，湖烟湿扃钥。\n主人苍玉佩，後骑黄金络。\n高视领八州，相期同一鹗。\n行当报知己，从此飞寥廓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}